SipilCAD @VERSION@ (web build)

Build   : @TAG@
Commit  : @COMMIT@
Source  : https://github.com/@SOURCE_REPO@/tree/@TAG@
Recipe  : BUILD.md at the same commit (build command, tool versions and post-build steps).

The WebAssembly binary (@WASM@) is served from the same folder as this page and is
built from the commit above. Dependency versions are pinned by Cargo.lock at that commit.

Based on Open CAD Studio by HakanSeven12 and contributors
(@UPSTREAM_AT@):
https://github.com/@UPSTREAM@  (GPL-3.0)

License: GNU General Public License v3.0 (see LICENSE.txt; identical copy in LICENSE).
The complete source code, including the build scripts, is available at the address above.

Third-party components served with this build:
- Web fonts (fonts/): Noto Sans and Noto Sans CJK subsets, SIL Open Font License 1.1.
  License text and copyright notices: fonts/OFL.txt (also embedded in each font file).
- PT Sans (splash screen and icon labels; fonts/PT_Sans-Web-*.ttf): SIL Open Font License 1.1,
  see OFL-PTSans.txt.
- LibreCAD LFF line fonts, embedded in the .wasm file (source: assets/fonts/*.lff in the
  repository above). Their file headers generally state the license: public domain (Hershey
  fonts) and/or GPL v2 or later.
- Rust libraries compiled into the .wasm file: the list and license texts are in
  THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt (generated by cargo-about from Cargo.lock, target wasm32).
